      "text": "trolled trial. J Clin Psychopharmacol 2019; 39:305–311.\n\t 5.\t Smith LA, et al. Acute bipolar mania: a systematic review and meta-analysis of co-therapy vs. monotherapy. Acta Psychiatr Scand 2007; \n",
